{"id":20904,"artist":"Jimmie Crane / Al Jacobs / Jimmy Brewster","title":"IF I GIVE MY HEART TO YOU","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:13.44] If I give my heart to you,\n[00:20.03] will you handle it with care?\n[00:26.34] Will you always treat me tenderly,\n[00:32.69] and in ev'ry way be fair?\n[00:38.70] If I give my heart to you,\n[00:45.29] will you give me all your love?\n[00:51.61] Will you swear that you'll be true to me\n[00:57.92] by the light that shines above?\n[01:04.49] And will you sigh with me when I'm sad,\n[01:13.50] smile with me when I'm glad,\n[01:19.00] and always be as you are with me tonight?\n[01:29.22] Think it over and be sure,\n[01:35.55] please don't answer till you do.\n[01:41.88] When you promise all those things to me,\n[01:47.82] then I'll give my heart to you.\n[01:54.51] And will you sigh with me when I'm sad,\n[02:03.65] smile with me when I'm glad,\n[02:09.93] and always be as you are with me tonight?\n[02:19.50] Think it over and be sure,\n[02:26.05] please don't answer till you do.\n[02:32.65] When you promise all those things to me,\n[02:38.98] then I'll give my heart to you.%-%+%-%+%-%+%-%+\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:13.44] <00:13.44>If <00:13.93>I <00:14.24>give <00:14.73>my <00:15.01>heart <00:15.78>to <00:16.09>you,\n[00:20.02] <00:20.02>will <00:20.28>you <00:20.56>han <00:21.03>dle <00:22.13>it <00:22.39>with <00:22.72>care?\n[00:26.34] <00:26.34>Will <00:26.57>you <00:26.86>al <00:27.31>ways <00:28.42>treat <00:28.68>me <00:28.98>ten <00:30.02>der <00:30.42>ly,\n[00:32.69] <00:32.69>and <00:32.94>in <00:33.23>ev <00:33.73>'ry <00:34.38>way <00:34.98>be <00:35.28>fair?\n[00:38.70] <00:38.70>If <00:39.19>I <00:39.50>give <00:39.99>my <00:40.28>heart <00:41.05>to <00:41.36>you,\n[00:45.28] <00:45.28>will <00:45.55>you <00:45.82>give <00:46.29>me <00:47.40>all <00:47.65>your <00:47.98>love?\n[00:51.60] <00:51.60>Will <00:51.83>you <00:52.12>swear <00:52.57>that <00:53.68>you'll <00:53.94>be <00:54.24>true <00:55